{"id": "33924", "title": "凯子金主", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33924.htm", "intro": "自小被没良心的父母给扔在孤儿院还不算惨啊, 她只不过是小小的任性出走一下下, 躲到那个男人的家窝几天, 她却被公司给“卖”了！！ 谁啊？哪个不长眼的凯子金主买她作啥啊？除了走台步、扮漂亮之外, 她一点女人该有的本事都不会说……他还没去找她！她倒自己送上门来啦！什么？她要当他的午餐”！？嗯……他当然知道天底下不会有白吃的午餐, 可是,他每天都亲自为她张罗三餐,还外带家庭管教, 一顿“午餐”哪够他回本哪！而且她浑身都带着扎人的“刺”,光是要剔掉她身上的刺,他早已饿得前胸贴后背了说……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33924", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2156905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2156906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2156907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2156908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2156909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2156910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2156911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2156912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2156913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2156914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2156915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2156916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2156917.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2156918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2156919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2156920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2156921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2156922.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2156923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2156924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2156925.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2156926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2156927.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2156928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页",